    "detailed_description": "This is a walking simulation software for VR.<br />\r\nYou can freely walk around the medieval European style world.<br />\r\nThere are no game elements at all, and you can enjoy all the elements in as little as five minutes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0How to move<br />\r\nThere are two ways to move: warp mode, which is very sickness-free, and smooth mode, which increases the sense of immersion.<br />\r\nYou can also jump by holding both hands at the same time. You can jump infinitely and continuously.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0Miniature Mode<br />\r\nA miniature mode has been implemented that allows you to observe the entire map at 1/100 scale.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0BGM<br />\r\nA total of six types of BGM are available to match the map, and can be changed freely.",
